      }
    },
    "토큰은 URL이면 Authorization: Bearer로 보내고, 이름을 적으면 그 헤더(예: x-api-key)로 보내요. 명령이면 적은 환경 변수(예: GITHUB_TOKEN)로 넘겨요.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For a URL the token is sent as Authorization: Bearer, or in the header you name (for example x-api-key). For a command it is passed in the environment variable you name (for example GITHUB_TOKEN)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
